Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个电台真够烂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The radio around here sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个案子可没那么诡异 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jobs don't get much weirder than this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,死掉的维克脖子上有咬痕 体内的血也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead vic with a gnawed-on neck, body drained of blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.17,0:01:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且证人也证实了那就是如假包换的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a witness who swears up and down that it was a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也同意 真是件棘手的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I … I agree. it's a hell of a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点激情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little more gusto, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就快世界末日了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…the world is coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情变得有点复杂 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are a little complicated, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们无法拯救世界 至少今天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we can't save the world, not today anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还可以砍下几个吸血鬼的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what we can do is chop off some vamps' heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,打起精神 伙计 就像平时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, it's like the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次真正的怪物猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}An honest-to-goodness monster hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到了温彻斯特家族重新处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time the winchesters got back to tackling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:02:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单上手黑白分明案子的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A straightforward, black-and-white case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:44.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,我们还是去看新电影《突袭者》吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still got to see the new "raiders" movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.51,0:02:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没和我一起看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你还在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,英式大脆饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big pretzel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guten tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安\N{\fnArial\fs30}"guten tag" yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是我们要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like that's our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官迪特里希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff dietrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the boys from the fed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查员安格斯和杨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents angus and young.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来调查你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called ahead about your, uh, problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不去人少点的地方聊聊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we talk this out away from the crowd, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽莎·莱特 26岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marissa wright, 26,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚在啤酒节上死于非命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just up from lockhard for the 'fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惨了 实在太惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible. just terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小镇在旅游高峰期\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This town needs at peak tourist season.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是玛丽莎·莱特需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely the last thing marissa wright needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可把我问住了 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got me … I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手是疯子对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This killer's some kind of grade-"a" wacko, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些撒旦的狂热者 安妮·赖斯小说的书迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, some satan-worshipping, anne rice-reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥特小说中的吸血鬼痴迷者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gothic, psycho vampire wannabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官 在你的报告中 提到有一名目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, in your report, you mentioned a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我希望没有 但目击者坚持作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wished I didn't. but our witness insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击者是爱德华 布鲁尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ed brewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们调查的不完全可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly what you'd call reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:04:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米\N{\fnArial\fs30}"jamie."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不忘记漂亮的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never forget a pretty… everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来找爱德华 布鲁尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for ed brewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,找爱德华干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we are, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}…federal agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁尔先生目击了犯罪过程 我们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. brewer was witness to a serious crime. we just.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你们是联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. you're a fed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来一点也不像探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you don't come on like a fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是独行侠 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a maverick, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,带徽章的反叛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rebel with a badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不拘泥于条条框框之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I don't play by … the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 独行侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maverick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们可以在哪里找到布鲁尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so, where can we find mr. brewer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉警察所有看见的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the cops everything I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one believes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:06:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们又有何不同呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should you be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 布鲁尔先生 我们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, mr. brewer, we're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对天发誓我说的是实话 现在我倒成了小镇的笑柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke the god's honest truth, and now I'm the town joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽莎·莱特被谋杀 这对我们来说不是玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marissa wright's murder is no joke to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想知道所有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we want to hear everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论有多荒诞\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how strange it may seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经历过很多的怪异事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a lot of experience with strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just after midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像往常一样离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just left here, and like I do every night,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过回家路上的公园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut through the park on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始 我以为有对情侣正在接吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, I thought it was a couple kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她挣扎的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she was… struggling too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.91,0:06:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在咬女的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was … well, he was biting her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以描述下攻击者的长相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you describe her assailant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he was a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么 你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, right. and by that, you mean …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:07:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是所熟知的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看上去像\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看上去像吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked like a vampire,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一对尖牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, with the fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,向后梳的头发还有一件奇特的斗篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the slicked-back hair and the fancy cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在绸缎上还有个像奖章一样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the little medallion thingy on the ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说德古拉（经典的吸血鬼形象）\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like a dracula?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 很像德古拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. like a dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着非常重的口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right down to the accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 口音 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The accent. yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似于\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, something like…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}"stay away, mortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.31,0:07:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜幕都是属于我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night is mine!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们相信我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do believe me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来这儿肯定是为了那个被谋杀的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be here following up on that murdered woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的爱德华和他的吸血鬼故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy ed and his vampire story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他特怪异 但并不疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might be weird, but he's not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才还说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.31,0:07:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迷倒了那个男孩还给了你20美元小费\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the guy has a crush on you and he tips you in $20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有啤酒喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you got a beer back there for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚 杨探员 你调查完了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, agent young. you off duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,变态崇拜吸血鬼的哥特人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goth, psycho vampire wannabe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该和我们的活没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely not our kind of case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶 不过谁关心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed. but who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间订好了 现在可是啤酒节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room's paid for, and it's oktoberfest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒还是酒吧女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer and bar wenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮女郎今天反映可不够热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure women today don't react well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于做爱这事 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the whole "wench" thing, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 小姐 我的啤酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bar wench, where's that beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up, good sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 啤酒节啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, oktoberfest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可不怎么能喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he doesn't drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个信教的科学家 可不想吃阿司匹林\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a christian scientist. doesn't even take aspirin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正被他的男朋友监视着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a real drag on stakeouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是还有一肚子的笑料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个你下班的时候我表演给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to get a chance to show you the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.08,0:08:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候开始？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time you get off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.64,0:08:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 就像我说的 真搞笑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha. like I said, "funny."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 是时候去做下坏事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, it is time to right some wrongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从地狱里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came back from the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没有留下任何疤痕 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without any of my old scars, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪伤 刀伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, bullet wounds, knife cuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那些个骨折的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the off-angled fingers from all the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的皮现在像婴儿般细腻光滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, my hide is as smooth as a baby's bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,总结来说就一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which leads me to conclude,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲哀 我还没碰过别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly… that my virginity is intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经重回了处男之身 - 重\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have been re-hymenated. - re.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 天使或许可以把你救出地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, maybe angels can pull you out of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人会干那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 我是重回了处男之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, I have been re-hymenated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作为情场浪子却不需要留着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the dude will not abide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你去挥霍你的处男之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you go do whatever you got to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我则回房去睡我的觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna go back to the room and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 今晚如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? How 'bout tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 抱歉 我答应了露西今晚是女孩之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry. I promised lucy a girls' night out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,此外 没自尊的酒吧女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, no self-respecting bar wench.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少可以自己挑选她的第一次服务的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lets herself get picked up by a customer on the first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我不是一个客人 我是一名联邦特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not a customer. I'm a federal agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天再来吧 联邦警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try again tomorrow, g-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我们会为了这个案子留下来 - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think we're staying on the case. - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你而言它太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it too weird for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不够诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not weird enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克 你听到了吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick. did you hear that? - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这声音听起来象是狼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded like a wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 玛丽 别再说这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, marie, don't change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过的对一个男人而言什么都可能发生 如果他不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you what could happen to a man if he doesn't …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.11,0:10:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些传说都是假的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Those stories aren't true. - they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 如果一个男人无法得到他想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, if a man doesn't get the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是在他有正常生理需求 让它忍耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of his system regularly, it can back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终就会导致 医学上的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cause all kinds of… medical-type problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜·玛丽 在宾夕法尼亚是没有狼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne marie, there aren't any wolves in pennsylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它就只是 只是把瑞克撕成了碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it just … it just tore rick into little pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 我们了解这有点为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, we understand how hard this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你能具体描述下这个生物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can you describe the creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是一个狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.05,0:12:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定 - 噢 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're sure? - oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛茸茸的脸上长着黑黑的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the furry face and the black nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一双利爪以及破碎的裤子和T-恤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the claws and the torn-up pants and shirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,和老电影演得一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like from the old movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是一个德古拉 现在又来一个老电影时代的狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First a dracula and now a full-on movie-time wolf man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该死的城镇究竟咋啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.55,0:12:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:13:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管这是不是一个精神错了的崇拜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever did this wasn't a psycho wannabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些咬痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at those bite marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好咬到骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right down to the bone…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者更深\N{\fnArial\fs30}And deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量大到足以将常人的四肢撕下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong enough to tear a healthy man apart limb from limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,极可能是狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 除非 瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏的碎片也在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart's still there in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们重来不会剩下心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never leave the heart behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不停地问 这他妈的究竟是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus I reiterate … what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你们两个可以告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was hoping you boys could tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚从化验室拿到他们赶出来的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a rush job back from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在尸体上我们发现了一些纤维\N{\fnArial\fs30}On those fibers we found on the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,犬齿 狼的毛发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canine. wolf hairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不通 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们失败在不看午夜场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we've stumbled on to a midnight showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如「德古拉会见狼人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of "dracula meets wolf man."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.09,0:13:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那出吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 狼人看起来确实是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, wolf man seems real enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它也让德古拉真实多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes dracula seem a little less impossible, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但是狼人是不长狼毛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but werewolves don't grow wolf hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那只一个神话故事 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's just a myth. - yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 要干什么 我们是到了一个有吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? we've got a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,和狼人怪物作怪的城镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a werewolf monster mashing this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们还会多待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked like you guys are staying a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了瑞克·迪肯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about rick deacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这个案子开始变得十分诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this case just got weird enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们这个部门而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}For, uh, our department.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 啤酒算我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, beers are on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 就像你知道的 我今天午夜下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, just so you know, I get off at midnight tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.69,0:14:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 今天不再是女孩之夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's not another, uh, girls' night out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 那么今晚见了 - 好的 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, then. I'll see you tonight. - okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你认为这个德古拉真的可以变成蝙蝠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you think this dracula could turn into a bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.19,0:14:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一点很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}bat would be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 和一个埃及人交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, an egyptian kind of deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只是坐在码头那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was just sitting there on the loading dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 博士 没有运输票据\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, doctor, there's no shipping invoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得海伦会不会什么记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think helen has any record of it in her files?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母玛利亚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mother of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个石棺可不古老\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sarcophagus isn't ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来自费城的一个道具仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from a prop house in philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就能解释里面配的这桶干冰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes well with the bucket of dry ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直是在里面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was keeping in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是要帮他制造出他想要的特效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he making his own special effects?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,正解 一个敬业的木乃伊演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a mummy with a good sense of showmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是够傻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.45,0:17:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 该死的 杰米 我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn it. jamie. I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好能留在这和木乃伊还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good here with the mummy and the…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿疯狂的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.75,0:17:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的损失 联邦警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your loss, g-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经远远的注视你很多晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have watched you many nights from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的激情告诉我没有搞错 米娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}My passion knows no bounds!mina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是爱人的转世\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the reincarnation of my beloved,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我必须拥有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I must have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 狗娘养…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not use such language.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的新娘面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the presence of my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamie, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在已经没有机会了 汉克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no choice in the matter, mr. harker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娜是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mina is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. you guys all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.19,0:19:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我还知道了这究竟是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of it at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这是耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the ear part?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:20:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,从德古拉脸上扯下来的 摸摸看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ripped it off of dracula's head. touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸起来熟悉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,道具定型皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skin of a shapeshifter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.49,0:20:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像圣·路易和雄鹿一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like st. louis and just like milwaukee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这一个充斥着满满的疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course this one's all holding buckets of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是飞行的时候掉下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must have fallen off during the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看在带子上的商标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the label on the ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是租来的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a costume rental.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有3个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}All three monsters …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼 狼人还有木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dracula, wolf man, and the mummy …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the same critter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就意味着我们要找同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means we need to catch this freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.35,0:20:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他变成另外一个怪物前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he "creature from the black lagoon's" somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们喜欢莫德和史卡利或其他的（X档案的演员）\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you guys are like mulder and scully or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么x档案是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the x files are real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 x档案是电视剧 这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, "the x files" is a tv show. this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 所以 编剧才能 服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, the stagecraft, the costuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉想他准备重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like he's trying to reenact.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最爱的恐怖电影时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}His favorite monster-movie moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是血腥谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right down to the bloody murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 谁是mina\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. who the hell is mina?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娜 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mina? yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫杰米\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he called jamie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.09,0:21:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫我汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he called me mr. harker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳森 汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonathan harker?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是电影「小说电影化」里的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're characters from the movies and the novels …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娜 德古拉的新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mina, dracula's intended bride,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.69,0:21:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克 是第三者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harker, the fianc that stands in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.49,0:21:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉为你定做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like he's fixating on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像把你当他的新娘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he sees you as his bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但盯这你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to fixate on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.72,0:21:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那变形人以前见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is that the shifter has to have seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,或在你周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or been around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米 有没有陌生人来这个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamie, has anybody strange come to town,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.99,0:21:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些对你有特别印象的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody that has taken a specific notice of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 迪恩 现在是啤酒节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, dean. it's oktoberfest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.65,0:21:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是调酒师 这里有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bartender. there's lots of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.35,0:21:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 那个爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. there is ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 布鲁尔的爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}"ed brewer" ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.69,0:21:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大概一个月前搬过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He moved here about a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西发誓说他爱上我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy swears he has a crush on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎每天晚上都来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes in almost every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.49,0:21:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 你知道 他不是我喜欢的那型\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, I don't think he's the type of guy …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华住那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does ed live?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.15,0:22:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.49,0:22:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他在老影院上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he works at the old movie theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他在那里当放映师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's a projectionist there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好米娜 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of mina? yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 怪物是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.49,0:22:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个变形人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the shapeshifter,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.22,0:22:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以变成不同的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can turn into different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的 除非已经变过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except this one's turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为电影节的伟大怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the great monsters of screenland,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说是新鲜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is a new one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是联邦探员 对么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not really fbi, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.37,0:22:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.87,0:22:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 你是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的同伴周游全国\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your partner just tramp across the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,花自己的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your own dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你们找到可怕的恶梦来对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you find some horrible nightmare to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.37,0:22:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些人付钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people paying for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.27,0:23:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是你们为了这些噩梦放弃自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're giving up your life for this terrible…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 责任感吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的几年 我才开始这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last few years, I started thinking that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 给自己点重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, you know, it started sort of weighing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那是之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that was before…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前 我有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little while ago, I had this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.34,0:23:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫死亡经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a near-death experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very near.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when I came to…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:24:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life's been different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到我可以帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that I help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.47,0:24:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是帮助他们 拯救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just help them, though. I save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.80,0:24:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 这个很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's … it's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.07,0:24:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是一种天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like a gift…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.07,0:24:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,像使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种上帝给的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a… a mission from god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.50,0:24:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 那个让你成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, does that make you…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些僧侣或别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of monk or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.77,0:24:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 独裁者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, celibate?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.27,0:24:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 我的天呐 杰米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap. oh, my god. jamie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 对 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm … I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.04,0:25:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你们俩出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you guys were going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.87,0:25:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露西 - 没事 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, it's … it's okay. uh, listen …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.47,0:25:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么么 我只是回来拿点酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I just … I came to borrow a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.20,0:25:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是拿点东西去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of got something going back at my…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 你们看上去很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, uh, you guys look really busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.00,0:25:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我准备消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm just gonna get out of your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.94,0:25:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 露西 今晚太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, lucy, it's been a crazy night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.50,0:25:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来一起喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. stay for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.44,0:26:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦探员 我做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, fbi man … what did I …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.24,0:26:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴好么 你知道你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, okay, you know what you did. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.00,0:26:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.27,0:26:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不是 我就是在演奏卡西欧电子琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not anything. I just like to play the casio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.90,0:26:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时间把耳朵张好是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had time to grow the ear back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.77,0:26:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.77,0:26:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! ow! ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.77,0:27:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵应该掉下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.40,0:27:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.84,0:27:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很可怕 杰米 亲爱的你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that sounds awful. jamie, honey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.44,0:27:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩，我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连碰都没碰到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.70,0:27:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩来的正是时候把他赶走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, he just blew right in and fought him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.34,0:27:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我不是真的打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't actually fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.50,0:27:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我当时确实这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sure it seemed that way at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.17,0:27:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was really, really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.17,0:27:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamie?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.70,0:27:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩你是黑带或是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, dean, are you like a black belt or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.14,0:27:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我认为他们是这样训练你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess they train you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.90,0:27:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在理论上是这样战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fight at the academy or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.54,0:27:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你这是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.47,0:27:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你干的 不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.87,0:28:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.64,0:28:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在酒里放什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you put in the drinks?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.47,0:28:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我亲自让你显原形\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right. I'll skin you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.30,0:28:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.89,0:29:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.39,0:29:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很漂亮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is beautiful, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.15,0:29:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一部的3号新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bride number three from the first film.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.69,0:29:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从来没得到她应得的喝彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never got the acclaim that she deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.69,0:29:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我选择变成她的形状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I chose her shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,用她的外形活动不会被其他人注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her form to move among the mortals unnoticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.15,0:29:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,聆听蟋蟀们的生命之曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}To listen to the cricket songs of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.99,0:29:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个时候我发现我的新娘复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is when I discovered my bride had been reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.75,0:29:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this century.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.72,0:29:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会原谅有着南瓜派眼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get over what a pumpkin-pie-eyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.02,0:29:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜生你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy son of a bitch you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.05,0:30:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是德古拉 你明白么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not dracula. you get that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.79,0:30:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你觉得你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or even if you think you are dracula,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.89,0:30:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个木乃伊是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's up with the mummy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.45,0:30:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的怪物都是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am all monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.45,0:30:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活不是电影 抱歉你这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life ain't a movie, you sorry sack of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.79,0:30:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.02,0:30:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命是渺小的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is small,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.35,0:30:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,贫乏而有混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meager, messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.69,0:30:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而电影是简单，豪华而有优雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The movies are grand, simple, elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.42,0:30:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择优雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have chosen elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.55,0:30:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所谓的优雅只是个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think "elegance" is really the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.89,0:30:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你对玛莉莎和瑞克 迪肯所做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what you did to marissa or rick deacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.89,0:30:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者还有没有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or any of the others?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.22,0:30:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.82,0:30:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后这是部恐怖电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a monster movie, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.55,0:30:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能意识到会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.12,0:30:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所有恐怖电影的结尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of every monster movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.25,0:31:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这部电影我才是编剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but this movie is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.32,0:31:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 怪物是赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in it, the monster wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.45,0:31:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物得到美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monster gets the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.75,0:31:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而英雄 被电死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the hero, he's…electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.32,0:31:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 乔纳森 哈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tonight, jonathan harker,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.99,0:31:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.35,0:31:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.72,0:31:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍等片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.92,0:32:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,送匹萨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…pizza delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.09,0:32:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你送来我的晚餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you've brought a repast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.42,0:32:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.75,0:32:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续服务他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue to be of such service.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.35,0:32:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会觉得你的生活很充实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your life will be spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.65,0:32:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.89,0:32:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共15块5\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be $15.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.39,0:32:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me… yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.55,0:32:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有大蒜么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is there garlic on this pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.15,0:32:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你有点么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. did you order garlic?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.85,0:32:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.15,0:32:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.45,0:32:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着先生 我还要送4家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, mister, I got four other deliveries to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.25,0:32:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给钱给我 我好走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to just pay me the money so I can go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.89,0:32:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我用优惠券\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have a coupon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.22,0:33:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩听着 爱德华不是我们要找的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hey, listen, uh, ed is not our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.65,0:33:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你和杰米现在在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm guessing you're at home with jamie,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.65,0:33:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以给我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just give me a cat1, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.62,0:33:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.05,0:33:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.59,0:34:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,长袍 很适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gown, it suits your beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.59,0:34:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.95,0:34:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am i?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.29,0:34:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对迪恩做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done with dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.45,0:34:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈克在别的地方休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harker is resting elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.65,0:34:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请穿上长袍 你可以用餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, put on the gown and you may dine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.82,0:34:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃匹萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are having pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.82,0:34:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.32,0:34:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在发什么疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.69,0:34:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西是你编出来的吧 准备做我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made up lucy, right? pretended to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.75,0:34:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道如果你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to know if you were the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.09,0:34:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以尝试和别人交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could try talking to people!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.59,0:34:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来取代你成为这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead you become this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.85,0:34:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,长袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.05,0:34:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和你玩这傻游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to play your stupid game, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.35,0:34:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.99,0:34:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上长袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on the gown!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.52,0:35:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我吓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.82,0:35:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我最不想吓到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the only one I don't want to scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.82,0:35:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经很喜欢这种电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to love the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.15,0:35:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.39,0:36:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't make them real.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.79,0:36:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实正在孕育\N{\fnArial\fs30}"real" is being born this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.85,0:36:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同的现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.25,0:36:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实就是你父亲叫你怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Real" is having your dad call you "monster" …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.89,0:36:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你听到的第一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first time you hear the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.35,0:36:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用铲子想把你打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he tries to beat you to death with a shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.69,0:36:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我逃到那里 躲到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere I ran, everywhere I tried to hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.55,0:36:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都能找到我 把我挖掘出来 攻击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}People found me, dragged me out and attacked me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.19,0:36:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我怪胎或怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called me "freak, " called me "monster."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.42,0:36:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我发现了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.09,0:36:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.89,0:36:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们的电影里 他们是强壮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In their movies, they were strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.32,0:36:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是可怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.09,0:36:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而又是漂亮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.89,0:37:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在的我就像他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I am like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.42,0:37:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,威风凛凛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.69,0:37:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.55,0:37:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.62,0:37:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.99,0:37:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.99,0:37:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.49,0:37:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你是不是因为杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think that maybe you're lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,才感到孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you kill people?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.49,0:37:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我孤独才去杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I kill people because I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.22,0:37:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.05,0:37:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.72,0:37:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.15,0:37:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.19,0:37:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 正是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank god. just in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.02,0:38:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙要虐待我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy was about to frankenstein me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.55,0:38:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.89,0:38:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.99,0:38:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远做不了范海辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never be van helsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.85,0:38:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 哈克 死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, harker, now you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.52,0:39:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你我就现在闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout now you shut the hell up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,银弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.39,0:39:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀这个怪胎真是完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was beauty that killed the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 米娜 不要哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, mina, do not weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.39,0:39:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能这就是为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps this is how.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.09,0:40:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you, g-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.15,0:40:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为你的国家做了件伟大的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been a great service to your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.25,0:40:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的 我十分 十分爱国的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I'm very, very patriotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.95,0:40:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.79,0:40:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.52,0:40:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys saved my life, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.35,0:40:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.25,0:40:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.25,0:40:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,回归正常感觉真好不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good to be back on the job, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.59,0:40:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.75,0:40:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄得到美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hero gets the girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.39,0:41:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物被消灭 一切的一切 完美结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster gets the gank … all in all, happy ending …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.95,0:41:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个完美结局 除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a happy ending, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.15,0:41:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real classy, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.89,0:41:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我要说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, all I'm saying is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.09,0:41:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道么 那变形人有一点是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shifter man had a point, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.12,0:41:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是生活像电影那样简单 那有多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be nice if life was movie simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.35,0:41:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我把生活变成电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, if I was turning life into a movie,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.69,0:41:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会演「两傻寻尸记」（1948年电影）这出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do this "abbott and costello meet the monster" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.02,0:41:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我懂你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. no, I know what you'd pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.35,0:41:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.52,0:41:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.22,0:41:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.39,0:41:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道 小猪2代\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't."porky's ii."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.05,0:41:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.
